{"catalog_version": 1, "point_id": "NP-1", "task_id": "corpus-08-Fake-News-Detection-NP-1-A-1-zh", "fields": {"claim": "5716c65f3adad9567892a62a58dc8b99a2a5f92863a7964d6836748e51dd59e8", "claim_en": "e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855", "technical_features[0]": "3df0733bca069cc88d013f98661f83649e9d33f9940322f95b1630c4ecea9b4b", "technical_features[1]": "87e18fd44c6bfd09a449e0074d676a2c85d812b4695660e9ab9a6992e195c53f", "technical_features[2]": "8bec7fa45742e77222b665225bffd7e6bd50c3572c7de326b3eca6c6be43a8b7"}, "sources": [{"source_id": "S-08888018b31bbcb2-001", "field": "claim", "field_index": null, "language": "zh", "start": 0, "end": 40, "text": "通过新闻摘要和预训练事实核验模型的串联，将事实核验能力迁移到零样本虚假新闻检测。", "sha256": "5716c65f3adad9567892a62a58dc8b99a2a5f92863a7964d6836748e51dd59e8"}, {"source_id": "S-08888018b31bbcb2-002", "field": "technical_features", "field_index": 0, "language": "zh", "start": 0, "end": 27, "text": "先用在新闻语料上预训练的摘要模型将长新闻压缩为短声明。", "sha256": "3df0733bca069cc88d013f98661f83649e9d33f9940322f95b1630c4ecea9b4b"}, {"source_id": "S-08888018b31bbcb2-003", "field": "technical_features", "field_index": 1, "language": "zh", "start": 0, "end": 29, "text": "再使用在FEVER数据上预训练的事实核验模型检测新闻真伪。", "sha256": "87e18fd44c6bfd09a449e0074d676a2c85d812b4695660e9ab9a6992e195c53f"}, {"source_id": "S-08888018b31bbcb2-004", "field": "technical_features", "field_index": 2, "language": "zh", "start": 0, "end": 25, "text": "采用零样本方式，减少对虚假新闻任务训练数据的依赖。", "sha256": "8bec7fa45742e77222b665225bffd7e6bd50c3572c7de326b3eca6c6be43a8b7"}]}